{"name":"Aqua Wish","hex":"#a0e3d1","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"aqua","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Water (as a compound).","A shade of colour, usually a mix of blue and green, most often similar to the colour cyan, though also sometimes closer to turquoise or aquamarine."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a greenish-blue colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/aqua"},{"term":"wish","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A desire, hope, or longing for something or for something to happen.","An expression of such a desire, often connected with ideas of magic and supernatural power."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To desire; to want.","To hope (+ object clause with may or in present subjunctive)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/wish"}],"entries":[{"title":"Wish","blocks":[{"text":"A wish is a hope or desire for something. In fiction, wishes can be used as plot devices. In folklore, opportunities for \"making a wish\" or for wishes to \"come true\" or \"be granted\" are themes that are sometimes used."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/I_samma_%C3%B6gonblick_var_hon_f%C3%B6rvandlad_till_en_undersk%C3%B6n_liten_%C3%A4lva.jpg/330px-I_samma_%C3%B6gonblick_var_hon_f%C3%B6rvandlad_till_en_undersk%C3%B6n_liten_%C3%A4lva.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wish","wikidata":"Q241625"},{"title":"Aqua (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Aqua is a variation of the color cyan. The normalized color coordinates for the two web colors named aqua and cyan are identical. It was one of the three secondary colors of the RGB color model used on computer and television displays. In the HSV color wheel aqua is precisely halfway between blue and green. However, aqua is not the same as the primary subtractive color named process cyan used in printing."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Shaheed_Island%2C_Andamans%2C_Bay%2C_Turquoise_water.jpg/330px-Shaheed_Island%2C_Andamans%2C_Bay%2C_Turquoise_water.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aqua_(color)","wikidata":"Q372733"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/%E9%93%B6%E6%BB%A9%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%B8%E6%84%BF%E6%A0%91_-_panoramio.jpg/500px-%E9%93%B6%E6%BB%A9%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%B8%E6%84%BF%E6%A0%91_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/%E9%93%B6%E6%BB%A9%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%B8%E6%84%BF%E6%A0%91_-_panoramio.jpg/1280px-%E9%93%B6%E6%BB%A9%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%B8%E6%84%BF%E6%A0%91_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/%E9%93%B6%E6%BB%A9%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%B8%E6%84%BF%E6%A0%91_-_panoramio.jpg/500px-%E9%93%B6%E6%BB%A9%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%B8%E6%84%BF%E6%A0%91_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Wishes written on red ribbons and tied to a tree in Beihai, Guangxi, China","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A%E9%93%B6%E6%BB%A9%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%B8%E6%84%BF%E6%A0%91_-_panoramio.jpg"}],"sounds":{"aqua":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a5/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-aqua.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a5/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-aqua.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-aqua.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a5/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-aqua.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-aqua.wav.ogg"}],"wish":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/